				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7e4b09d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7e4b09d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>We collaborate with industry leaders to deliver cutting-edge automation solutions</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-66a7aad e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="66a7aad" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e6088e2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e6088e2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7dc78e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b7dc78e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Your Labelling Partner</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-acdec2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="acdec2f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h5 data-start="131" data-end="203"><strong data-start="135" data-end="203">WORLDPACK: </strong>The Preferred Gateway for Automated Labelling Systems</h5>
<p data-start="416" data-end="769">
</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-63b5fb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="63b5fb0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p data-start="205" data-end="414">At WorldPack, innovation meets precision. We are a trusted name in the design and manufacture of self-adhesive labelling machines, delivering solutions that power efficiency and elevate production standards.</p><p data-start="205" data-end="414"><br></p>
<p data-start="416" data-end="769">Driven by a passionate team with over 35 years of experience in manufacturing, engineering, design, and customer service, WorldPack combines proven expertise with youthful energy. Our commitment to excellence and constant innovation continues to push boundaries—helping brands automate smarter, label faster, and achieve perfection with every product.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-67cd633 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="67cd633" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/about-company/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
						<span class="elementor-button-icon">
				<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z"></path></svg>			</span>
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Learn More About Us</span>
					</span>
					</a>
								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b56e41 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7b56e41" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
